      "evidence": "The reply says the expense was saved for October 10, but saved_state has occurred_on null and the owner gave no date, so the date is invented and misstates the saved draft. The draft is saved with no money record and not approved, and the reply claims neither approval nor posting. The question about whether the owner paid out of pocket is plain and useful, and the owner can answer it. \"Pesos\" is acceptable given the default DOP currency, though the currency origin is only a default.",
      "honest_saved_state": false,
      "no_claimed_approval": true,
      "no_invented_facts": false,
